---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy - Momo Toolbox';
const description = 'Momo Toolbox Privacy Policy: tool data is processed locally in the browser; Cloudflare Web Analytics, Google Analytics and Google AdSense are used, with details on cookies and opt-out options.';
const updatedZh = '2026年10月26日';
const updatedEn = 'October 26, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title={title} description={description} canonical="https://www.web-tools.top/en/privacy">
  <article class="legal-page">
    {/* Static SEO h1: bilingual switching, ensures exactly one h1 on the page */}
    <h1 data-zh="隐私政策" data-en="Privacy Policy">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated"><span data-zh={`最后更新：${updatedZh}`} data-en={`Last updated: ${updatedEn}`}>Last updated: {updatedEn}</span></p>

    <div data-lang="en">
      <p>Momo Toolbox ("we") takes your privacy seriously. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle data when you use this website (www.web-tools.top).</p>

      <h2>Core Promise: Local Tool Processing</h2>
      <p>All tools on this website (including but not limited to JSON formatter, Markdown editor, QR code generator, password generator, hash calculator, etc.) process data locally in your browser.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Content you enter into the tools is <strong>never</strong> sent to our servers</li>
        <li>All computation, conversion, and generation happen on your device</li>
        <li>We do not collect any content data you process with the tools</li>
        <li>One tool (AI background removal) downloads model/runtime assets from a third-party CDN, but your images and inputs are never uploaded</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Local Storage (localStorage)</h2>
      <p>To provide a better experience, we use browser local storage to save the following preferences. This data exists only on your device:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Language preference</strong> (<code>momo-lang</code>): remembers your chosen UI language</li>
        <li><strong>Theme preference</strong> (<code>momo-theme</code>): remembers your light/dark theme choice</li>
        <li><strong>Starred tools</strong> (<code>momo-starred</code>): records your favorite tools</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can clear this data anytime via your browser settings without affecting normal use of the site.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
      <p>The tools themselves do not use cookies. Third-party analytics and advertising services (Google Analytics, Google AdSense) may set cookies or read device identifiers when you visit. Language, theme and favorites preferences are stored in browser localStorage and are not sent with requests.</p>
      <p>You can clear or block cookies in your browser settings, or turn off personalized advertising in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>. Blocking cookies does not affect the tools themselves.</p>

      <h2>Traffic Analytics</h2>
      <p>We use the following three methods to understand traffic and page performance, all for improving the site:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong>: no tracking cookies; aggregate traffic statistics only. See the <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics 4</strong>: uses cookies (such as <code>_ga</code>) to measure page views, referrers, device information and approximate region. Google states that it does not store full IP addresses. You can opt out with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Self-hosted Web Vitals reporting</strong>: pages send performance metrics (LCP, CLS, INP, FCP, TTFB), page path, User-Agent and timestamp to our Cloudflare Worker (<code>momo-vitals.wecccfk.workers.dev</code>) to help diagnose performance. This data does <strong>not</strong> include anything you enter into the tools.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>AI Background Removal Model Downloads</h2>
      <p>AI background removal runs the ISNet model locally in your browser. On first use, the model and WebAssembly runtime (~40–80MB) are downloaded from IMG.LY's CDN (staticimgly.com) and cached in your browser's IndexedDB. These requests expose connection information such as your IP address to that CDN, as any ordinary web asset request would. <strong>Your images are never uploaded to that CDN or to our servers.</strong></p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>This website uses the following third-party services, each with its own privacy policy:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong>: hosting, CDN acceleration, Web Analytics and the performance-reporting Worker. Cloudflare may process your IP address for network transit and aggregate stats. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong>: web font loading. Google may collect your IP address and request information. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> (Google LLC): traffic statistics. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> (Google LLC): advertising. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Advertising Policies</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>IMG.LY</strong>: provides AI background removal model and runtime assets (staticimgly.com). See <a href="https://img.ly/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IMG.LY Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Advertising</h2>
      <p>This website uses <strong>Google AdSense</strong> to display ads that keep the service running. Google and its partners may use cookies (including the DoubleClick cookie) to serve personalized ads based on your visits to this and other websites, and to measure ad performance.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Ad units are separated from tool controls and never read or associate with what you enter into the tools</li>
        <li>You can disable personalized advertising in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>, or manage third-party ad cookies at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a></li>
        <li>Core tool functionality remains free; advertising is the revenue source that keeps the site running</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>This website is intended for a general audience and is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us at the email below and we will delete it.</p>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>Since your tool data never leaves your device, data security is entirely under your control. We recommend using a modern browser and keeping your system up to date.</p>

      <h2>Policy Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When updated, we will publish the new version on this page and update the "Last updated" date. We encourage you to review this page periodically for any changes.</p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us via email: <a href="mailto:1902243211@qq.com">1902243211@qq.com</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);">
      <a href="/en/" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline;" data-zh="← 返回首页" data-en="← Back to Home">← Back to Home</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
